CONTEXT School NAMED Campus INCLUDES Library FROM "../contexts/library.adl" NAMED Campus

CONTEXT School IN ENGLISH

PURPOSE CONTEXT School
{+ Both contexts are given the database Campus. The classification puts the members of the library and the
pupils of the school in one typology, and in one database that is one table. +}

CLASSIFY Pupil ISA Library.Member
RELATION class[Pupil*Class] [UNI]
POPULATION class[Pupil*Class] CONTAINS [ ("m1", "1A") ]

RULE pupilsHaveNames : I[Pupil] |- Library.memberName;Library.memberName~
MEANING "A pupil is a member and so has a name."
ENDCONTEXT
